#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:1
msgid "HM-D20-4G 首次使用"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G Getting Started"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **HM-D20-4G** 从开箱状态运行到首次获得 **RTK 固定解**。开始前需准备可用的 "
"Nano-SIM 卡和 CORS/NTRIP 账号，并确认现场有蜂窝网络覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Set up **HM-D20-4G** from unpacking through its first **RTK fixed "
"solution**. Before starting, prepare an active Nano-SIM card, a CORS/NTRIP "
"account, and cellular coverage at the site."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:9
msgid "1. 核对设备与配件"
msgstr "Step 1: Check the equipment and accessories"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:11
msgid "产品标配："
msgstr "Standard Product Configuration:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:12
msgid "HM-D20-4G 移动站。"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G rover."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:13
msgid "8-pin GH1.25 mm 连接线。"
msgstr "8-pin GH1.25 mm connector cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:14
msgid "外置 4G 天线。"
msgstr "External 4G antenna."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:15
msgid "USB-C 配置线。"
msgstr "USB-C configuration cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:16
msgid "兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 UART 转接器。"
msgstr "USB-to-UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:18
msgid "用户自备："
msgstr "User provides:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:19
msgid "5 V ±0.5 V 电源。"
msgstr "5 V ±0.5 V power supply."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:20
msgid "有流量的 Nano-SIM 卡。"
msgstr "Nano-SIM card with data."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:21
msgid "CORS/NTRIP 账号。"
msgstr "CORS/NTRIP account."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:28
msgid "HM-D20-4G 主要组件与包装"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G major components and packaging"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:28
msgid "HM-D20-4G 主要组件"
msgstr "HM-D20-4G major components"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:32
msgid ""
"图片用于辅助识别产品和主要组件；实际交付内容以本页文字清单和随货装箱清单为"
"准。"
msgstr ""
"Images are provided to help identify the product and its major components. "
"The written list on this page and the packing list supplied with the product "
"define the actual contents."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:35
msgid "2. 确认输出固件"
msgstr "Step 2: Confirm the output firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:37
msgid "接入 ArduPilot、PX4 等飞控：使用无人机版固件，默认输出 10 Hz UBX。"
msgstr ""
"For ArduPilot, PX4, and similar flight controllers, use the UAV firmware; it "
"defaults to 10 Hz UBX."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:38
msgid "接入机器人、Viobot2 或 PC：使用地面版固件，默认输出 10 Hz NMEA。"
msgstr ""
"For robots, Viobot2, or a PC, use the ground firmware; it defaults to 10 Hz "
"NMEA."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:40
msgid ""
"固件由订单用途确定。需要调整时，先阅读[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/"
"firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The firmware is determined by the order purpose. When adjustments are "
"needed, first read [Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](../operation/"
"firmware-output.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:42
msgid "3. 安装 4G 天线"
msgstr "Step 3: Install the 4G antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:44
msgid ""
"断电状态下，将外置 4G 天线连接到 SMA 接口并拧紧。天线可以布置到机臂或其他合适"
"位置，避免紧贴大功率设备、金属遮挡或平台内部强干扰源。"
msgstr ""
"When powered off, connect the external 4G antenna to the SMA interface and "
"tighten it. The antenna can be positioned on the arm or other suitable "
"locations, avoiding close proximity to high-power equipment, metal "
"obstructions, or strong interference sources inside the platform."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:46
msgid "4. 写入 CORS 账号"
msgstr "Step 4: Enter CORS account"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:48
msgid ""
"使用标配 USB-C 配置线连接设备配置口和 PC，按[4G / CORS 配置](../differential-"
"links/4g-ntrip.md)写入服务器、端口、挂载点、账号和密码，并确认工具返回成功。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the configuration port to the PC with the supplied USB-C cable. "
"Follow [4G / CORS Setup](../differential-links/4g-ntrip.md) to enter the "
"server, port, mount point, username, and password, then verify a successful "
"response."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:50
msgid "5. 连接供电与 UART"
msgstr "Step 5: Connect power and UART"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:53
msgid ""
"接线错误会损坏设备 保持设备断电并按[完整 8-pin 定义](../operation/d20-wiring."
"md)逐线核对。设备供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，UART/PPS I/O 为 3.3 V；禁止按导线颜色判"
"断、反接电源或把 5 V 接入信号线。"
msgstr ""
"Wiring errors can damage the device. Keep it powered off and verify every "
"wire against the [complete 8-pin pinout](../operation/d20-wiring.md). Supply "
"5 V ±0.5 V; UART/PPS I/O is 3.3 V. Do not rely on wire colors, reverse the "
"supply, or connect 5 V to a signal pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:56
msgid "按[D20 接口与接线](../operation/d20-wiring.md)完成连接："
msgstr ""
"Complete the connection as described in [D20 Interfaces and Wiring](../"
"operation/d20-wiring.md):"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:58
msgid "Pin 6（5 V）接 5 V ±0.5 V 电源正极，Pin 1（GND）接电源负极并共地。"
msgstr ""
"Pin 6 (5 V) is connected to the positive terminal of a 5 V ±0.5 V power "
"supply, and Pin 1 (GND) is connected to the negative terminal of the power "
"supply with a common ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:59
msgid "设备 TX 接外部 RX，设备 RX 接外部 TX。"
msgstr "Device TX connects to external RX, device RX connects to external TX."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:60
msgid "仅使用定位时，SCL/SDA 可不连接。"
msgstr "When using positioning only, SCL/SDA may not be connected."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:61
msgid "再次核对 Pin 顺序、信号、电压和极性后上电。"
msgstr ""
"Power on after rechecking the pin order, signals, voltage, and polarity."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:63
msgid "6. 查看定位输出"
msgstr "Step 6: Check positioning output"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"串口默认 115200 bps。使用地面版固件时，按{ref}`连接 NavStarTool <connect-"
"navstartool>`或使用串口终端确认 10 Hz NMEA 持续输出；使用无人机版固件时，通过"
"目标飞控及其地面站确认 UBX 定位数据和 GPS 状态持续更新。"
msgstr ""
"The serial port defaults to 115200 bps. When using the ground firmware, "
"follow {ref}`Connecting to NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` or use a "
"serial terminal to verify continuous 10 Hz NMEA output; when using the UAV "
"firmware, verify continuous updates of UBX positioning data and GPS status "
"through the target flight controller and its ground station."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:67
msgid "7. 验证 RTK 固定解"
msgstr "Step 7: Verify RTK Fixed Solution"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:69
msgid ""
"将设备放置在天空视野开阔的位置，然后按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/"
"rtk-fixed-validation.md)检查定位输出和解状态。"
msgstr ""
"Place the device with an open sky view, then follow [Checking RTK Status and "
"the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md) to verify "
"positioning output and solution status."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:71
msgid "首次使用完成判据"
msgstr "Getting Started success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:74
msgid "**定位数据持续输出，并进入 RTK 固定解。**"
msgstr ""
"**Positioning output remains continuous and reaches an RTK fixed solution.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:77
msgid ""
"若无法进入固定解，检查 4G 天线、Nano-SIM 卡流量、网络覆盖、CORS 账号、天线视"
"野和供电，再进入[故障排查](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If unable to obtain a fixed solution, check the 4G antenna, Nano-SIM card "
"data, network coverage, CORS account, antenna line of sight, and power "
"supply, then proceed to [Troubleshooting](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting."
"md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-4g.md:79
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

